Q1: Validation before SLA calc?None exists. If vendor_id is not found, rows = [], sla_compliance = None, and the code still proceeds to DELETE+INSERT a row into sla_tracker_output with NULL compliance. No "Vendor not found" error is raised anywhere. — handler.py:30-68
