Q2: Exact JOIN condition:handler.py:45 — JOIN vendor_master_input m ON m.name = v.name — joined on name (TEXT), not vendor_id.
Q3: Is name UNIQUE in vendors?No. init_db.py:50-65 — name TEXT with no UNIQUE constraint in either vendors or vendor_master_input. A name mismatch or name collision silently returns wrong/no data; fetchone() picks the first row.
